                      "item/requestv2/inputText": "Compare these two records and determine whether they represent the same or substantially similar application, product, initiative, project, or request.\n\nRecord A\nName: @{items('Each_Request_Intake')?['bdgas_digitalproductname']}\nDescription: @{items('Each_Request_Intake')?['bdgas_description']}\n\nRecord B\nName: @{items('Each_CREDO_Item')?['name']}\nDescription: @{items('Each_CREDO_Item')?['description']}\n\nInstructions:\n- Compare both Name and Description.\n- Consider semantic meaning, business purpose, functionality, objectives, and keywords.\n- Similar wording is not required. Match based on meaning.\n- Return a SimilarityScore from 0 to 100:\n  - 90-100 = Essentially the same item\n  - 70-89 = Highly similar\n  - 50-69 = Possibly related\n  - 0-49 = Different\n- Set IsMatch to true only when SimilarityScore is 70 or above.\n- Response must be valid JSON.\n- Do not include explanations, markdown, code fences, comments, or any text before or after the JSON.\n- Return exactly this structure and nothing else:\n{\n  \"SimilarityScore\": <integer>,\n  \"IsMatch\": <boolean>\n}",
                      "item/source": {
                        "consumptionSource": "PowerAutomate",
                        "partnerSource": "AIBuilder",
                        "consumptionSourceVersion": "Flow",
                        "partnerSourceVersion": "131c01d6-2302-96ab-34b9-77566412c4bc"
                      }
                    },
